 4. 🦾 Chart du jour: Data center dominance 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Bureau of Labor Statistics, FactSet. Chart: Matt Phillips/Axios More and more, there's the AI economy — and everything else, Axios markets correspondent Matt Phillips writes. 

 Why it matters: The growing chasm between the breakneck growth of the AI world and the slower pace of the economy where most Americans work and live has huge implications, especially for the markets. The most recent numbers on U.S. construction spending through August — shown above — paint the picture remarkably clearly.

