 7. 🍭 Your state&#x27;s craving 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: DoorDash . Map: Sami Sparber/Axios Reese's rules Halloween candy nationally — but some states have their own favorites, Axios' Sami Sparber writes from new DoorDash data . 

 Sweet Smiles, a Dollar General brand that sells an assortment of sweets, stands out in seven Southern states. Laffy Taffy claims five states across the Midwest. Share this map . 

 
 
